  "doctrine": {
    "summary": "ROC Army reorganising around an asymmetric 'porcupine' defence of the island: beach and urban defence, mobile anti-armour and anti-ship missiles, HIMARS, drones and a large reserve, with conscription restored to one year from 2024. Being equipped with M1A2T Abrams (108 by 2026), AH-64E, Javelin and Stinger; annual Han Kuang exercises rehearse defeating a landing.",
    "squad_size": 9,
    "fireteam": "Rifle squad of 9 with T75 LMG and grenadier; anti-armour teams with Javelin/Kestrel. Game: 8 in four pairs.",
    "tactics": [
      "Beach and port defence: obstacles, mines and fortified positions as map features",
      "Mobile shoot-and-scoot anti-armour teams (Javelin, Kestrel, TOW)",
      "Urban defence using reserve and civil-defence forces",
      "HIMARS and drone strikes on landing forces",
      "Rapid counter-attack by Abrams and CM-34 against beachheads"
    ],
